                    "toast": {
                    "message": "Abedo pacu, TAS Dating okwanyo AI ma kwede i bot app megi. Kwat kany ka ineno mite kede AI otime me moko nyutu me lamal maber! <a href='TASDatingInnovationsLandingPage/index.html'>kono</a>",
                    "author": "Ber, TAS Dating Team",
                    "close": "Kube",
                    "link": "AI"
                    },
                    "hero": {
                        "title": "Pe iweyo me kekeny, pe iweyo me kwo, obedo, dok ki tye kekeny ma nying, moti nino obedo?"
                    },
                    "infoText": {
                        "paragraph1": "Too All Sweet en aye app ma ceto kony mar bedo nying ikom dating ma konyo tic mabeco matwal bedo marwate. App man eni acel ma oketi Reels i yeny pa dating apps, konyo ngec makato ki tic marwate matwal.",
                        "paragraph2": "App eni otiyo ki lok pa Acholi woko ma onenge i 131 lok, konyo lwongo jami i yweyo. Gin me tic ma tek gin ma tye calo Spotlight, nyutu mar acel i Match algorithm, kok ki wa pa Full HD ma dokonyo woko ki woko ki rwom, kany i lobo ki tic makwonga calo Business Mode, rwong mogo me user verification, Explore, Relations, ki gin ma kumu madong dong, ma konyo app man bedo nying iye ma woko i yeny me tic matwal ikom lobo."
                    },
