            "paragraph1": "Too All Sweet wani sabo ne na manhajar sada zumunta ta amfani da sabuwar fasaha don samar da sauƙin amfani ga masu amfani. Wannan manhaja ce kawai wadda ta gabatar da tsarin Reels a cikin duniya na manhajojin sada zumunta, tana ba da damar amfani mai kyau da kuma jin daɗi.",
            "paragraph2": "An fassara shi cikin harsuna 131, yana ba da damar amfani a duk duniya. Muhimman abubuwa sun haɗa da Spotlight, na musamman algorithm na dacewa, kiran bidiyo da sauti na Full HD kyauta, da sauran ayyuka kamar Business Mode, tabbatarwar mai amfani, Explore, Relations, da sauransu, wanda ke sa ta zama mafi sabbin dandamali a kasuwa."
